WEBVTT

00:21.040 --> 00:22.590
Who in this world

00:23.440 --> 00:26.260
can defy death?

00:28.380 --> 00:33.340
Ancient Temple Dark Bamboo Grove

00:42.550 --> 00:43.740
Who are all these people

00:44.360 --> 00:45.480
in the portraits?

00:47.240 --> 00:48.550
They

00:49.280 --> 00:54.310
are the ancestral deities
from the legends of Jiuzhou,

00:55.000 --> 00:57.550
who have ascended to the World of Immortals

00:57.880 --> 00:59.870
and gained immortality.

01:00.080 --> 01:01.430
The World of Immortals?

01:02.200 --> 01:04.070
Master, have you ever been there?

01:06.480 --> 01:10.630
I've cultivated for a century, making
several attempts to enter the path.

01:11.640 --> 01:14.749
Yet, each time, I was held
back at the Heavenly Gate due

01:14.750 --> 01:16.940
to the dwindling spiritual
energy across Jiuzhou.

01:18.520 --> 01:22.270
If, in this life, you are fated
to encounter immortality,

01:22.920 --> 01:27.590
may you witness the World
of Immortals on my behalf.

01:58.700 --> 02:04.450
A ray of light, a glimpse of hope

02:05.340 --> 02:10.890
Rising through thorns, a
glimmer through the cracks

02:12.080 --> 02:17.840
Look up and behold, transcending time

02:18.710 --> 02:24.320
Through ages and cataclysms,
I'll stand watch for you

02:25.030 --> 02:30.690
Even millennia later, I won't forget you

02:31.560 --> 02:37.070
In a world without
you, I'll defy fate itself

02:37.080 --> 02:42.330
Cracks, piercing through the heart

02:42.800 --> 02:49.350
Armoured, at the end of a vast battlefield

02:49.700 --> 02:55.710
Light slipping through my fingers

02:56.290 --> 03:02.800
My fate, under my command
who cares if it's divine or demonic?

03:02.820 --> 03:09.220
Cracks, piercing through the heart

03:09.580 --> 03:13.699
Eternity unbroken,
love and hate left behind

03:13.700 --> 03:18.820
All passed by

03:20.430 --> 03:25.710
Cracks, piercing through the heart

03:26.330 --> 03:33.150
Armoured, at the end of a vast battlefield

03:33.160 --> 03:39.510
Light slipping through my fingers

03:39.520 --> 03:46.300
When the end arrives,
no one will destroy me

03:46.450 --> 03:49.660
Forever unyielding

03:53.050 --> 03:58.760
Forever undying

03:59.460 --> 04:01.400
World of Immortals

04:01.401 --> 04:02.460
 Dragon Island Arc

04:04.060 --> 04:06.540
Episode 1

04:06.541 --> 04:09.020
Breaking the Void

04:10.100 --> 04:12.860
Town at the
Foot of
Jiuzhou
Hongchen
Peak

04:15.760 --> 04:19.030
<i>Ten years of hard cultivation,
ten years of being sheltered.</i>

04:20.120 --> 04:21.750
<i>The heart on the path is now complete.</i>

04:22.660 --> 04:23.660
<i>Today,</i>

04:24.330 --> 04:25.660
<i>it's time to move forward.</i>

04:31.020 --> 04:33.500
September 9th

04:33.501 --> 04:35.980
Jiuzhou Calendar Year 763

04:39.000 --> 04:40.810
The Return to the Origin

04:40.950 --> 04:43.000
marks the Beginning of Unity.

04:43.480 --> 04:46.910
Today, the Divine Maiden
ascends to the World of Immortals,

04:47.400 --> 04:51.770
allowing the people to journey
to Hongchen Peak to offer prayers

04:52.160 --> 04:54.590
and together behold her celestial grace.

05:04.700 --> 05:06.430
It's been several hundred years in Jiuzhou

05:06.440 --> 05:08.396
since anyone ascended to
the World of Immortals, right?

05:08.420 --> 05:09.950
Will the Divine Maiden succeed?

05:10.620 --> 05:11.719
There's no need to doubt.

05:11.720 --> 05:14.510
The Divine Maiden was unbeatable
at 20 when she faced the world.

05:14.520 --> 05:16.580
After retreating to Snow Valley,
she achieved divine enlightenment.

05:16.590 --> 05:17.690
She will surely succeed!

05:20.460 --> 05:21.599
Royal Cultivator

05:21.600 --> 05:22.870
How is the arrangement going?

05:23.320 --> 05:24.350
Everything is in place.

05:24.430 --> 05:25.610
Once the culprit shows up,

05:25.790 --> 05:26.720
there will

05:26.721 --> 05:27.830
be no escape.

05:46.540 --> 05:48.340
- Xiao Chen
- Yet to Transcend the Ordinary

06:01.710 --> 06:02.990
Her Highness has issued a decree.

06:03.000 --> 06:04.656
With the Divine Maiden's ascension at hand,

06:04.680 --> 06:06.590
all actions must not
disturb the celebrations.

06:07.120 --> 06:08.150
Be quick and efficient.

06:16.320 --> 06:17.320
Where's that person?

06:21.120 --> 06:22.760
<i>Three people are hiding behind the eaves,</i>

06:22.850 --> 06:24.919
<i>breathing heavily as
they practice martial arts,</i>

06:24.920 --> 06:26.490
<i>likely familiar with blades and swords.</i>

06:26.800 --> 06:28.690
<i>The four on the left and
right are breathing lightly,</i>

06:28.700 --> 06:30.936
<i>indicating they are skilled in
concealed weapon assassination.</i>

06:30.960 --> 06:32.310
<i>If there are only seven of them,</i>

06:33.310 --> 06:34.390
<i>they can be fought against.</i>

06:38.600 --> 06:40.270
It's already remote enough here,

06:40.510 --> 06:41.896
so if you all don't make a move soon,

06:41.920 --> 06:42.990
I will be leaving.

06:59.400 --> 07:01.030
You are the culprit, Xiao Chen,

07:01.040 --> 07:02.990
from the Huanghe Ancestor Dragon Village.

07:03.160 --> 07:05.030
You have harmed a royal maiden.

07:05.400 --> 07:07.430
By the decree of Her
Highness, the Divine Maiden,

07:07.600 --> 07:09.000
you are to be executed on the spot.

07:33.400 --> 07:34.750
I've said it many times.

07:34.840 --> 07:37.150
The death of that maiden
has nothing to do with me.

07:38.410 --> 07:40.290
Regardless of whether
it was your doing or not,

07:40.680 --> 07:42.150
you must die today.

07:43.310 --> 07:45.030
You have lost all sense of right and wrong.

07:53.180 --> 07:54.180
If you

07:54.490 --> 07:55.519
lay a hand on me,

07:55.520 --> 07:57.390
the princess will make you pay.

07:57.850 --> 07:58.950
If I let you go,

07:59.160 --> 08:00.750
will you all back off?

08:25.240 --> 08:26.390
Xiao Chen, the condemned,

08:26.480 --> 08:27.590
the princess has arrived.

08:27.600 --> 08:29.070
Will you not confess and bow down?

09:04.940 --> 09:06.220
Royal Celestial Maiden

09:04.940 --> 09:07.500
Mortal Shedding First Level

09:04.940 --> 09:06.119
You

09:06.120 --> 09:07.670
are Xiao Chen.

09:06.221 --> 09:07.500
Zhao Lin<i>'er</i>

09:07.720 --> 09:09.510
I came to witness the goddess's ascension,

09:09.670 --> 09:10.670
not to fight.

09:10.710 --> 09:12.870
It was your maid who stirred
up trouble for no reason,

09:12.960 --> 09:14.270
leading to her accidental death.

09:14.400 --> 09:16.470
Falling off the cliff was her own fault.

09:17.310 --> 09:18.150
Kill him.

09:18.150 --> 09:19.150
Yes.

09:23.040 --> 09:25.230
<i>These maids' encirclement
formation is quite tricky.</i>

09:25.760 --> 09:27.190
<i>I can't afford to be immobilised.</i>

09:34.400 --> 09:35.590
You're a martial artist.

10:02.740 --> 10:04.140
Heavenly
Gifted
Qi
Cultivation
Diagram

10:14.360 --> 10:15.470
Don't follow me.

10:15.520 --> 10:16.910
You're no match for him.

10:17.240 --> 10:18.080
Your Highness.

10:18.100 --> 10:19.100
Your Highness.

10:19.140 --> 10:21.020
Let's see how far you can run.

10:46.060 --> 10:47.380
Rainbow Sword Technique

11:01.180 --> 11:02.696
<i>Although I can manage
to protect myself for now,</i>

11:02.720 --> 11:03.970
<i>it's not a long-term solution.</i>

11:04.200 --> 11:05.290
<i>I need to escape quickly.</i>

11:32.760 --> 11:34.150
<i>The deepest human emotions</i>

11:34.520 --> 11:35.790
<i>are what we cherish most,</i>

11:37.630 --> 11:39.350
<i>as many linger in these feelings,</i>

11:40.110 --> 11:41.350
<i>finding joy in forgetting time.</i>

11:43.360 --> 11:44.870
<i>Yet, despite all our affection,</i>

11:45.120 --> 11:47.110
<i>it's hard to resist the erosion of time</i>

11:48.180 --> 11:49.556
<i>that turns everything to withering.</i>

11:49.580 --> 11:51.620
Jiuzhou Goddess

11:49.580 --> 11:51.319
Nirvana Realm First Level

11:51.320 --> 11:53.110
<i>Prosperity is just a passing cloud.</i>

11:51.621 --> 11:53.660
Lan Nuo

11:54.310 --> 11:56.710
<i>If one can't untangle the bonds
of resentment and affection,</i>

11:58.880 --> 12:01.090
<i>how can one rise above the ordinary world?</i>

12:17.140 --> 12:18.299
Why did that last move

12:18.300 --> 12:19.470
go astray?

12:24.240 --> 12:25.630
Why hasn't the goddess arrived yet?

12:25.631 --> 12:31.740
Jiuzhou
Hongchen
Peak,
Hanging
Temple

12:27.160 --> 12:28.000
That's right.

12:28.020 --> 12:28.900
She should be coming out soon.

12:28.910 --> 12:31.910
What does it really mean
to ascend to immortality?

12:33.240 --> 12:34.110
The elders say

12:34.120 --> 12:36.430
that once the martial artists of
Jiuzhou reach a certain level of mastery,

12:36.440 --> 12:38.160
they will ascend to the World of Immortals,

12:38.600 --> 12:41.150
where there are
opportunities for immortality.

12:41.360 --> 12:42.430
Immortality?

12:42.600 --> 12:43.600
Is it really true?

12:45.120 --> 12:46.120
Who knows?

12:46.400 --> 12:48.990
But some have indeed ascended in the past.

12:50.880 --> 12:51.720
Quick, look!

12:51.840 --> 12:52.680
Over there.

12:52.700 --> 12:53.660
The goddess is here.

12:53.661 --> 12:58.020
Hongchen Peak

12:53.960 --> 12:55.030
Quick, look!

13:10.480 --> 13:11.480
The time

13:11.960 --> 13:12.960
has come.

13:26.950 --> 13:28.160
My heart on the path

13:28.520 --> 13:30.430
has reached a state
of clarity and serenity.

13:31.200 --> 13:32.200
Divine guidance,

13:32.640 --> 13:33.640
break the seal.

13:43.260 --> 13:48.220
Heavenly Gate of Jiuzhou

14:01.590 --> 14:04.300
With each step, there
comes a mundane tribulation.

14:05.120 --> 14:08.250
When the road ends,
dust and fate will scatter.

14:14.760 --> 14:16.120
<i>The sword opens the Heavenly Gate.</i>

14:16.690 --> 14:18.220
<i>The goddess is about to ascend.</i>

14:19.650 --> 14:20.800
You rural townsfolk,

14:20.960 --> 14:22.190
if you do not perish today,

14:22.200 --> 14:24.120
the royal family's
reputation will be tarnished.

14:26.200 --> 14:28.190
Forget the feelings that have been lost,

14:29.080 --> 14:31.380
and you shall attain immortality.

14:32.180 --> 14:33.820
Forget the past

14:34.760 --> 14:36.190
to attain immortality.

14:37.480 --> 14:40.990
Will I still be myself then?

14:46.920 --> 14:49.150
Although your heart on the path is strong,

14:49.420 --> 14:51.880
the worldly thoughts still linger.

14:52.280 --> 14:54.400
A slight deviation

14:54.920 --> 14:58.180
can lead to an impassable
chasm to immortality.

15:17.210 --> 15:18.360
Look!

15:18.850 --> 15:19.800
What is that?

15:19.800 --> 15:20.800
What is happening?

15:27.740 --> 15:28.960
<i>The heavenly fire descends.</i>

15:29.160 --> 15:30.830
<i>The goddess's ascension has failed.</i>

15:31.980 --> 15:34.100
The heart of heaven is difficult to fathom.

15:34.720 --> 15:36.630
Immortal feelings are as cold as frost.

15:37.500 --> 15:40.000
Although you have a
steadfast heart on the path,

15:40.560 --> 15:43.550
you have ultimately failed to
comprehend the worldly tribulations.

15:49.440 --> 15:50.830
<i>I have long severed</i>

15:51.810 --> 15:53.300
<i>my ties to mundane feelings.</i>

15:54.280 --> 15:56.670
<i>Is that not sufficient?</i>

16:26.840 --> 16:28.390
<i>To achieve immortality,</i>

16:28.420 --> 16:30.296
<i>one must not simply be
devoid of emotions or desires.</i>

16:30.320 --> 16:32.576
<i>Rather, it is essential to remain
free from emotional attachments</i>

16:32.600 --> 16:33.870
<i>and not be bound by love.</i>

16:36.720 --> 16:38.390
<i>Divine guidance gathers spiritual energy,</i>

16:39.390 --> 16:42.070
<i>and only through achieving nirvana
can one attain true immortality.</i>

16:47.650 --> 16:49.690
You have not yet attained
emotional detachment.

16:50.160 --> 16:52.630
How can you possibly think of ascending?

17:02.600 --> 17:03.670
<i>The heavens are eternal,</i>

17:04.720 --> 17:05.970
<i>but feelings are hard to sever.</i>

17:41.140 --> 17:42.580
Eternal
Guarding
of the
Yellow River

18:00.960 --> 18:05.220
Dragon
Island of the
World of
Immortals

18:25.040 --> 18:28.360
Heavenly Horse

18:40.510 --> 18:41.510
<i>Dad.</i>

18:41.840 --> 18:42.840
<i>Mom.</i>

18:45.630 --> 18:46.630
Ruo Shui.

19:03.560 --> 19:04.560
What

19:05.100 --> 19:06.490
place is this?

19:28.620 --> 19:30.620
Coastal Cliffs

19:30.621 --> 19:32.620
Evil Dragon Beach

19:42.120 --> 19:44.270
What kind of monster is that?

19:47.540 --> 19:51.780
Eight-armed Evil Dragon

19:55.840 --> 19:56.840
What is that sound?

19:57.440 --> 19:58.440
My head!

20:14.820 --> 20:15.820
Was that just now

20:16.520 --> 20:17.520
a dragon?

20:18.280 --> 20:19.280
Have I

20:19.970 --> 20:21.330
arrived in the World of Immortals?

20:32.760 --> 20:33.760
Is this

20:36.280 --> 20:37.280
a dragon egg?

20:39.420 --> 20:41.156
The dragon is the
foremost of sacred beasts,

20:41.180 --> 20:43.260
and this dragon egg is
certainly no ordinary object.

20:44.700 --> 20:47.030
I never expected that the
legendary sacred beast of Jiuzhou

20:47.040 --> 20:49.190
truly exists in the World of Immortals.

20:51.000 --> 20:52.000
Is that...

21:01.400 --> 21:03.720
You are Xiao Chen.

21:05.170 --> 21:06.630
Has she also come here?

21:16.240 --> 21:18.270
The egg of the Eight-Armed Evil Dragon.

21:18.580 --> 21:19.860
Immortal Apprentice

21:18.580 --> 21:21.140
Mortal Shedding First Level

21:19.200 --> 21:21.350
This person is quite fortunate.

21:19.861 --> 21:21.140
Liu Yue

21:21.660 --> 21:23.640
Immortal Apprentice

21:21.660 --> 21:25.620
Wang Zifeng

21:21.920 --> 21:23.190
Looking at his attire,

21:23.420 --> 21:25.460
he does not resemble
someone from the major powers.

21:23.641 --> 21:25.620
Mortal Shedding First Level

21:26.700 --> 21:28.660
We should first clarify
this person's background.

21:31.310 --> 21:33.550
<i>The weather in this World
of Immortals is truly bizarre.</i>

21:33.760 --> 21:34.830
<i>It changes in an instant.</i>

21:43.600 --> 21:44.800
<i>This place is secluded,</i>

21:45.010 --> 21:46.470
<i>making it quite suitable for hiding.</i>

22:08.440 --> 22:09.550
Zifeng, hurry here.

22:09.600 --> 22:11.240
There's a place to shelter from the rain.

22:14.560 --> 22:15.760
There is already someone here.

22:23.560 --> 22:25.550
I am Wang Zifeng from the Undying Sect.

22:25.720 --> 22:27.750
I came here carelessly to
seek shelter from the rain,

22:27.760 --> 22:29.080
so I hope you won't take offense.

22:29.230 --> 22:30.820
I am Liu Yue from the Undying Sect.

22:31.080 --> 22:32.360
I apologise for the disturbance.

22:33.560 --> 22:34.560
I am Xiao Chen

22:34.720 --> 22:35.720
from the Mortal Realm.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.630
- The Mortal Realm?
- The Mortal Realm?

23:08.240 --> 23:15.240
A heart untouched by
dust, letting the past remain

23:15.830 --> 23:21.430
Old wounds hidden away by the years

23:22.410 --> 23:26.410
Turning through forgetfulness

23:26.760 --> 23:29.800
Fate is long-lasting

23:29.980 --> 23:35.350
Yet I still faintly remember your image

23:36.460 --> 23:39.339
Your gentle smile like the breeze

23:39.340 --> 23:43.270
A light shadow flowing
like water, with no echo

23:43.670 --> 23:46.389
Grant me a lifetime of wind and snow

23:46.390 --> 23:50.320
Together, we'll admire the
moonlight until the end of time

23:50.730 --> 23:54.900
A glance back feels like the first meeting

23:55.080 --> 23:58.020
The touch still warm to the skin

23:58.620 --> 24:00.439
The departed return to seek

24:00.440 --> 24:04.210
No regrets for the love once shared

24:04.680 --> 24:07.459
If only tender feelings could last forever

24:07.460 --> 24:11.520
Nourishing beauty as I look back once more

24:11.800 --> 24:14.579
I wish for the sea to remain untroubled

24:14.580 --> 24:18.560
The heart stays the same,
do not ponder too much

24:18.860 --> 24:23.269
That year by the jade zither,
listening to the flowers fall

24:23.270 --> 24:26.550
Ripples at the centre of tears

24:26.820 --> 24:28.739
This love can wait

24:28.740 --> 24:32.660
To see that yellowing scene again

24:33.870 --> 24:35.779
Through the long years

24:35.780 --> 24:40.450
Together with you in vastness

24:40.940 --> 24:43.949
Asking the world

24:43.950 --> 24:47.800
How can love be complete?

24:48.090 --> 24:51.209
Remembering the past years

24:51.210 --> 24:54.660
Always feeling indebted

24:55.090 --> 24:57.790
When will we

24:58.110 --> 25:01.940
Meet again?

25:02.140 --> 25:04.870
Once stood side by side

25:05.300 --> 25:09.150
Talking for ages

25:38.660 --> 25:46.660
Next Episode

25:39.040 --> 25:41.150
I am in this plight because of you.

25:42.480 --> 25:44.910
I will make sure you
suffer a terrible fate.

25:45.600 --> 25:47.910
The dragon egg is a rare treasure.

25:48.310 --> 25:52.120
No one should know
that we have obtained it.

25:53.720 --> 25:56.800
You dare to plot against my
disciple from the Immortal Sect.

26:03.480 --> 26:04.480
Perhaps

26:05.070 --> 26:07.700
you deserve a more tragic death.

26:08.740 --> 26:10.900
World of Immortals

26:10.901 --> 26:11.980
 Dragon Island Arc
